Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.75,0:00:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I braided it the other day, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.29,0:00:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You just let her do what she wants, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.62,0:00:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.62,0:00:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's so cute, Miyamura-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.54,0:00:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I love your hair like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.08,0:00:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Me, too! You should keep it that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.66,0:00:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Hori-san did it for you? It's adorable!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.58,0:00:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, your face is so tiny and cute, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.08,0:00:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, there's the bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.16,0:00:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.41,0:00:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,--Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.95,0:00:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,--Hori! It's not his fault!\N--Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.91,0:00:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,--Hori! It's not his fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.29,0:00:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.08,0:00:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.58,0:01:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Horimiya"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.70,0:02:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, can I have my bag?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.75,0:02:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you mad at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.50,0:02:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it because of those girls?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.00,0:02:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah, duh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.58,0:02:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,They treated you like you were invisible before,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.87,0:02:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,but as soon as you cut your hair,\Noh, {\i1}now {\i0}they see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.83,0:02:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And they keep putting their paws\Nall over you right in front of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.16,0:02:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.87,0:03:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.70,0:03:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyamura?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.62,0:03:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It {\i1}is {\i0}you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.45,0:03:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You should probably stop, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.12,0:03:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,He's all gloomy and depressing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.45,0:03:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, I totally couldn't tell.\NGood eye, Tanihara.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.50,0:03:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Dude, you're such an ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.66,0:03:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So what? You been doing okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.75,0:03:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,--Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.41,0:03:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,--Damn, dude, you got tall.\NAnd holy shit, your piercings.\N--Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.20,0:03:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,--Damn, dude, you got tall.\NAnd holy shit, your piercings.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.54,0:03:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Glad you guys are doing okay, too, Tanihara.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.29,0:03:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, when you say my name,\Nit totally skeeves me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.12,0:03:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What, did you finally grow\Na pair in high school? Dumbass.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.29,0:03:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,And what the hell? You having\Nsome weak-ass chick carry your bag?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.95,0:03:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut it out, Tanihara.\NShe might be his girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.87,0:03:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, you really scored, Miyamura. Nice job.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.87,0:03:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon, say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.54,0:03:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.50,0:04:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, are you his girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.04,0:04:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know what he was like in middle school?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.20,0:04:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,He was so emo and always by himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.87,0:04:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk about pathe--
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.70,0:04:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.08,0:04:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm {\i1}asking {\i0}if you guys are done talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.20,0:04:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.12,0:04:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.75,0:04:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are, then piss off, assholes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.16,0:04:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I was already in a crappy mood,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.45,0:04:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,but then they started treating you like that.\NHow was I supposed to hold back?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.37,0:04:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.62,0:04:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously, I can't believe\Nthey were so mean to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.91,0:04:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"It's Hard, but Not Impossible"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.91,0:04:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.41,0:04:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"It's Hard, but Not Impossible"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.91,0:04:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,A small fry and a drink. Is that all?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.54,0:04:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, Tanihara...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.50,0:04:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you start taking\Nkarate classes or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.50,0:04:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I just ran into Miyamura.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.70,0:04:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyamura?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.00,0:05:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you use to tease\Nhim back in middle school?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.66,0:05:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Bunnies"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.70,0:05:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.33,0:05:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Y'know, there was this chick with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.08,0:05:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I think she was his girlfriend.\NDo you know her, Shindo?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.16,0:05:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyamura's girlfriend? Oh, you mean Hori-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.50,0:05:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So her name's Hori-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.58,0:05:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You should probably stop\Nteasing him like you did back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.54,0:05:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyamura's really leveled up his DEF stats.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.04,0:05:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What, is his girlfriend his summon or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.66,0:05:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He says he doesn't care about him,\Nbut he keeps bothering him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.70,0:05:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He just can't get him out of his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.54,0:06:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Does it hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.66,0:06:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What're you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.04,0:06:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.54,0:06:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Hori-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.58,0:06:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on? Out with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.25,0:06:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I have someone who'll get mad on my behalf.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.70,0:06:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,She's right here with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.70,0:06:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,U-Use your open hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.87,0:06:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a little slap!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.91,0:06:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.45,0:06:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not? You did it before,\Njust do it again, like {\i1}bam{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.20,0:06:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I {\i1}said{\i0}, no way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.45,0:06:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.79,0:06:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one more!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.25,0:06:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the least punchable face ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.95,0:06:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon, she's begging you, Miyamura!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.00,0:06:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the hell did you come from, Shindo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.37,0:06:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.16,0:06:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just gonna stalk you from afar,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.75,0:07:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,but you were being so mean to\NHori-san that I just couldn't just watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.12,0:07:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of man are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.54,0:07:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You were stalking me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.50,0:07:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay out of this.\NYou have no idea what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.25,0:07:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, it's probably something sexual, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.62,0:07:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at {\i1}all{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.87,0:07:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Aww, what, do you not love me anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.41,0:07:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-That's not it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.16,0:07:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Aww, poor Hori-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.58,0:07:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Quiet, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.04,0:07:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I can help you instead!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.33,0:07:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever you want, I'm here.\NOr am I the wrong man for the job?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.45,0:07:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep. It's gotta be Miyamura.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.62,0:07:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So it {\i1}is {\i0}something sexual!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.54,0:07:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you even have a brain in there, dude?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.41,0:07:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, we're leaving! C'mon, Hori-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.91,0:07:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hori-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.75,0:07:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Louder.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.29,0:07:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.29,0:07:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Move your ass, Kyoko!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.83,0:07:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Later, Shindo! And this\N{\i1}isn't {\i0}anything sexual, got it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.54,0:07:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,G-Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.37,0:07:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, can we go by the\Nconvenience store, Miyamura?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.87,0:07:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, you dumb bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.62,0:08:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What the actual hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.33,0:08:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Tanihara.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.29,0:08:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thirsty. Buy me a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.83,0:08:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Buy your own damn drink!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.91,0:08:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, who put a stick up {\i1}your {\i0}ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.37,0:08:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.75,0:08:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop loitering in the parking lot, morons.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.33,0:08:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell's your problem, bitch?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.41,0:08:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's his summon{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.12,0:08:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,How about you take your bitch ass and--
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.95,0:08:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't talk to her like that, you moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.33,0:08:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Why're you yelling at {\i1}me{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.00,0:08:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not loitering! We're picking up trash!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.37,0:08:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah! We're Recycling Buddies!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.83,0:08:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that it? Good work, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.87,0:08:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.70,0:08:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Dude, if you'd pissed her off,\Nshe would've bashed our skulls in!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.45,0:08:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What, like some monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.00,0:08:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, isn't that Miyamura?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.00,0:08:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh. Next time I see that guy--
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.37,0:08:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Got snacks!"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.37,0:08:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh. Next time I see that guy--
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.62,0:08:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"WHAP"\N"You sure took your time, bitch!"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.12,0:08:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"You sure took your time, bitch!"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.62,0:08:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"I'm sorry. I'm so sorry."\N"Get a move on, moron!"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.95,0:08:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Us < Kyoko Hori < Miyamura"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.95,0:08:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a monster, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.79,0:08:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a monster, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.12,0:08:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.33,0:09:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell happened to you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.04,0:09:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't mean to kinkshame, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.41,0:09:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Is she right in the head?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.04,0:09:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hori-san, look...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.41,0:09:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine. Whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.58,0:09:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just going to stop thinking about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.62,0:09:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyamura sure has changed, like damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.25,0:09:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,A high school transformation?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.91,0:09:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That's still some transformation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.79,0:09:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He barely talked back to us in middle school,\Nand now he's hitting girls?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.29,0:09:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.62,0:09:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you're leaving?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.91,0:09:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.08,0:09:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm back!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.00,0:09:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm heading out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.95,0:09:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Already?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.12,0:10:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Be back by dinner!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.75,0:10:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You're still here, Kyosuke?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.50,0:10:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I have to say this,\Nbut this is my house, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.91,0:10:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Kyosuke-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.00,0:10:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Could I ask you for your advice?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.91,0:10:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell yeah, I'm in!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.29,0:10:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what? That's suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.37,0:10:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut it, it's time for a man-to-man!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.25,0:10:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what's up? You good?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.66,0:10:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Why're we in the bathroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.62,0:10:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a question for you about Hori-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.50,0:10:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, she preggers again?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.87,0:10:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, {\i1}again{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.58,0:10:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, just... she really likes it\Nwhen I get mad and yell at her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.75,0:10:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell? Is that her kink or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.41,0:10:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Deflates"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.41,0:10:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell? Is that her kink or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.04,0:10:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Deflates"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.04,0:10:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I thought, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.41,0:10:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I thought, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.79,0:10:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's just 'cause it's the exact\Nopposite of how you normally act?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.79,0:10:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The exact opposite?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.25,0:10:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Like if you got all dressed up\Nto go to the office?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.04,0:10:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Smart!"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.04,0:10:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Like if you got all dressed up\Nto go to the office?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.58,0:10:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Smart!"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.58,0:10:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch, but yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.00,0:11:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Think of it like taming a fierce golem!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.08,0:11:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.70,0:11:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon, get out of there.\NHow am I supposed to bathe?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.12,0:11:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyoko! C'mere and sit down!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.83,0:11:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.95,0:11:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But look how sad and worried Miyamura-kun is!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.33,0:11:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You're such a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.41,0:11:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyamura-kun's trying {\i1}so {\i0}hard\Nto live up to your expectations!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.58,0:11:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! Where's this coming from?!\NI don't need {\i1}you {\i0}to lecture me here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.16,0:11:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop blabbing about stupid crap\Nand help out with the chores for once!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.79,0:11:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,She has a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.87,0:11:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow, my feelings!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.41,0:11:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I made curry the other day! That counts!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.87,0:11:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it doesn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.33,0:11:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,All you did was microwave it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.08,0:11:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But you said it was yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.79,0:11:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, because they make\Nthe prepackaged stuff yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.12,0:11:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Sota even got seconds!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.70,0:11:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is it perfectly warm?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.45,0:11:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyamura-kun's dripping wet!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.83,0:11:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,--Get your clothes off, quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.54,0:11:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,--Wait, hold on!\N--Get your clothes off, quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.87,0:11:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't strip in front of me, moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.87,0:11:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,So I went to karaoke with Shu the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.79,0:12:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing in English? No way, man! It's way too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.66,0:12:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,All he ever sings are {\i1}enka {\i0}songs and rap.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.33,0:12:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He sure does listen to everything, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.29,0:12:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I know he listens to\NWestern pop, too, but damn...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.45,0:12:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mizouchi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.00,0:12:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, straight ignored.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.29,0:12:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably 'cause I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.37,0:12:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.33,0:12:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently he has a crush on Hori-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.08,0:12:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, how many guys want to be with her now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.20,0:12:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,"rrrrrumble..."\NDamn, how many guys want to be with her now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.45,0:12:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,"rrrrrumble..."\NThere's one thing I know\Nabout crushing on Hori-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.08,0:12:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,"rrrrrumble..."\NDon't fall for her unless you really mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.70,0:12:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't fall for her unless you really mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.12,0:12:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of Hori, where's she at?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.41,0:12:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The student council room, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.41,0:12:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't have my phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.54,0:12:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you leave it in the science lab?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.41,0:12:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go look.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.70,0:12:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Science Lab"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.16,0:12:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you forget something, too, Mizouchi-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.66,0:12:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you seen my phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.41,0:12:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.00,0:12:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.62,0:13:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would it be in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.08,0:13:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, nobody else has\Nhad class in here since we did,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.54,0:13:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,so it's gotta still be in here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.79,0:13:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your number?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.16,0:13:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.16,0:13:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll call it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.08,0:13:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Umm, 090...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.33,0:13:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.62,0:13:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It was in your pocket the whole time?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.20,0:13:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks! You're a lifesaver--
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.37,0:13:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, why's the screen all black?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.33,0:13:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you break it two seconds later?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.70,0:13:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the hell is she with you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.04,0:13:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I didn't mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.87,0:13:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mizouchi-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.12,0:13:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,If you had to... could you punch Hori-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.91,0:14:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! Punch her?! Like, if were fighting?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.75,0:14:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I suppose, kinda.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.83,0:14:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh. I could {\i1}never {\i0}hit Hori!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.91,0:14:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.91,0:14:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you could never be with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.29,0:14:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Miyamura! Did you find your phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.04,0:14:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.54,0:14:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Toru told me you're always\Nleaving it all over the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.41,0:14:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd better be more careful with your--
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.33,0:14:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut the hell up, bitch! Stay quiet for once!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.87,0:14:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.62,0:14:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,--Hori!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.95,0:14:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,--Leave her alone, Mizouchi-kun.\N--Hori!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.91,0:14:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,--Leave her alone, Mizouchi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.83,0:14:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh... uh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.20,0:14:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyamura...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.41,0:14:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you were the kind of guy\Nwho could never stand up for himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.00,0:14:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you were some loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.04,0:15:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But guess it's easy for you to be\Nconfident around your girlfriend, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.16,0:15:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, super easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.20,0:15:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, why are your eyes all red?!\NWere you rubbing them or something?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.04,0:15:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyamura! Go away, there's not enough room!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.83,0:15:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Go where?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.00,0:15:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Outside, jeez! Where are we, anyway?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.45,0:15:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.75,0:15:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.62,0:15:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This is outside. The only free space there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.33,0:15:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?! This locker\Nor whatever isn't "outside" at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.66,0:15:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what it's like "outside."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.37,0:15:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You've always been on the "inside,"\Nso you don't know how it feels.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.70,0:15:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Inside, outside, what the hell are you on about?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.29,0:15:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who brought it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.66,0:15:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I think this is the first time\Nwe've ever talked like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.12,0:15:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you not like tight spaces?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.00,0:15:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.50,0:15:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh. So do I.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.58,0:15:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you like being on the inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.12,0:16:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's better than {\i1}this{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.08,0:16:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if there's nobody on the inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.33,0:16:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,If all the people on the inside\Nwith you came outside,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.41,0:16:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,then you'd be all alone in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.79,0:16:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.79,0:16:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't care if you're inside or outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.54,0:16:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You just care that people are there with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.75,0:16:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,People who are on your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.54,0:16:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.91,0:16:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.91,0:16:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Bunnies"
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.50,0:16:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Miyamura's number?\NYeah, I have it, but why do you want it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.58,0:16:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't matter, just tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.91,0:17:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, just hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.87,0:17:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone knew the rabbits liked\NMiyamura better than anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.33,0:17:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Why're we talking about rabbits?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.79,0:17:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up. Just tell me his number.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.16,0:17:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, he's ignoring me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.12,0:17:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Izumi! Could you go take the sign in?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.20,0:17:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.25,0:17:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys closed already?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.87,0:17:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, we'll be closed tomorrow, too,\Nbut we'll be open the day after...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.04,0:18:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If you turn the corner and go down for a bit,\Nyou'll find another cake shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.08,0:18:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll find a much bigger bakery\Nthat's probably still open now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.33,0:18:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I want something from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.29,0:18:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.58,0:18:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine, I'll come back\Nthe day after tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.37,0:18:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear your cheesecake's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.83,0:18:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.95,0:18:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Cool. See you in two days, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.33,0:18:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, our fruit tart's good!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.25,0:18:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's good, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.91,0:18:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll get that one, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.54,0:18:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Two of each.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.83,0:18:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Two of each, got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.20,0:18:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.16,0:18:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.33,0:18:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I tried calling you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.04,0:18:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You did?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.75,0:18:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, my phone's busted.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.87,0:19:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go get it fixed tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.08,0:19:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.70,0:19:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I totally thought he was ignoring me...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.70,0:19:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I was the one ignoring {\i1}him {\i0}all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.62,0:19:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.41,0:19:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Did it stress you out?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.00,0:19:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.58,0:19:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,No, never mind! I'm heading out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.37,0:19:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Tanihara-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.16,0:19:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.79,0:19:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot to feed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.29,0:19:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though I was supposed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.91,0:19:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,By end of summer break, they were all dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.62,0:19:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I was the one who told\Neveryone it was your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.54,0:19:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It was me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.62,0:20:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.54,0:20:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyamura, you know, I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.25,0:20:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.87,0:20:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.08,0:20:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What if I'd been able to tell him back then?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.04,0:20:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It hurts my heart to think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.87,0:20:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.95,0:20:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for helping out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.87,0:20:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yearbooks!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.33,0:20:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's from middle school.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.95,0:20:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What'd she look like back then?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.66,0:20:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Peek and you're a dead man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.54,0:20:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,They're so annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.70,0:20:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,They're big, and in the way, but you don't\Nactually wanna throw them away...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.04,0:20:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you throw yours away already, Miyamura?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.37,0:20:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Yearbook"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.37,0:20:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you throw yours away already, Miyamura?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.54,0:20:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Yearbook"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.54,0:20:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.04,0:20:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Yearbook"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.08,0:21:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But they're so huge and heavy,\NI didn't know what to do with them,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.50,0:21:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,so I just ended up keeping them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.75,0:21:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, though, they're actually\Npretty important to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.33,0:21:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Back then, Miyamura must've\Nwanted to throw it all away.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.25,0:21:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what he was\Nlike back in middle school,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.20,0:21:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,but I get the feeling that he hated\Neverything and was just drifting along.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.00,0:21:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That that's what life was like for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.33,0:21:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But now, he can look back and feel glad\Nthat he didn't throw it all away.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.12,0:21:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonder what Katagiri's\Nyearbook is going to look like.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.62,0:21:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess we'll find out when we get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.37,0:21:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,They took the pictures\Nfor it back in April, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.08,0:21:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope they got a picture\Nof me with Mizouchi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.00,0:21:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, why Mizouchi?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.37,0:21:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We've kinda gotten close lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.87,0:21:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.16,0:21:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He helped me find my phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.66,0:22:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He was kind of mean\Nto me before, but it's all good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.66,0:22:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Does he get off on that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.87,0:22:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I might get along\Nwith Tanihara-kun, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.37,0:22:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.20,0:22:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It might be really hard,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.91,0:22:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,but I don't think there's a person in the world
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.12,0:22:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,you can't eventually be friends with.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.58,0:23:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Next Time: Until the Snow Melts"
